    "body": "Currently the wallet has a metadata cache that handled refreshing mint info and keysets. We should ensure that this can handle a wallet being used when it is offline (maybe it can already?). If the wallet is offline when a refresh is tried we should just fallback to what is already in the localstore.  ",
