    "body": "\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nPopulate the in-memory metadata cache from the database without HTTP requests. Useful for offline scenarios and fast startup. The load() method now tries load_from_db before falling back to load_from_mint.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n### Notes to the reviewers\r\n\r\n<!-- In this section you can include notes directed to the reviewers, like explaining why some parts\r\nof the PR were done in a specific way -->\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n### Suggested [CHANGELOG](https://github.com/cashubtc/cdk/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md) Updates\r\n\r\n<!-- Please do not edit the actual changelog but note what you changed here. -->\r\n\r\n#### CHANGED\r\n\r\n#### ADDED\r\n\r\n#### REMOVED\r\n\r\n#### FIXED\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\n### Checklist\r\n\r\n* [x] I followed the [code style guidelines](https://github.com/cashubtc/cdk/blob/main/CODE_STYLE.md)\r\n* [x] I ran `just quick-check` before committing\r\n* [x] If the Wallet API was modified (added/removed/changed), I have reflected those changes in the FFI bindings (`crates/cdk-ffi`)\r\n",
